<title>SWITZERLAND: Zurich inflation slows to 0.4 pct yr/yr in June.</title>
<headline>Zurich inflation slows to 0.4 pct yr/yr in June.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zurich consumer prices rose 0.1 percent in June from May for a year-on-year inflation rate of 0.4 percent, the cantonal statistics office said.</p>
<p>				June 97	May 97     June 96</p>
<p> Monthly change in pct  +0.1	   -0.4	 +0.3</p>
<p> Yr/Yr change	     +0.4	   +0.6	 +0.6</p>
<p> Index (May 1993=100)  103.0	  102.9	102.6</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
